<title>USA: WPP Group's J. Walter Thompson names Jones CEO.</title>
<headline>WPP Group's J. Walter Thompson names Jones CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>J. Walter Thompson Worldwide, a unit of WPP Group Plc, on Friday said that Chris Jones has been named chief executive officer, from January 1. Jones will succeed Burt Manning, who will remain chairman of the advertising agency. Previously, Mr. Jones was co-president, a position he shared with Peter Schweitzer, who will remain president of the global agency.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
